            "description": {
              "content": "Create a new run via External API.\n\nRequires scope: runs:create\n\nThe run will execute asynchronously. Use webhooks or polling to track status.\n\nReturns:\n    Run ID and initial status. Poll GET /external/runs/{id} or configure\n    webhooks to receive status updates.",
